{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MANEKIN: The Lost Island is a single-player action-adventure developed with Unreal Engine 5. As the world teeters on the brink of collapse, the Manekin Order\u2014moving from the shadows\u2014detects an electromagnetic fog over a forgotten island in the open ocean. Their best agent is dispatched to investigate, but contact is abruptly lost, and the mission falls to you. Come ashore on mist-shrouded coasts, follow the tracks, read the environment, and uncover the truth behind the story. Fight with a hybrid combat system that features fluid modern firearms; explore forest paths and abandoned villages. Gather new weapons, attachments, and supplies as you progress. The game opens with a cinematic and preserves your progress with a save-and-continue structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940500/extras/b108171b7157f0621e25e66dd34abaa2.poster.avif?t=1758360731\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940500/extras/b108171b7157f0621e25e66dd34abaa2.webm?t=1758360731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940500?t=1758360731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940500?t=1758360731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940500/7e79fec12cafe090880407ac5360d8ff09ddecc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758360731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940500/7e79fec12cafe090880407ac5360d8ff09ddecc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758360731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purcha